      "message": "fix(post): keep a record whose stream ends share one ray as a full turn\n\nA record whose own ends in the stream are on one ray from the centre\nhas a zero stream sweep. emitArcWithRadius reads that as a full turn\n(the 359.99 degree case of radius_arcs.rs arrives so after the stream\nrounding). The same-angle rule now acts only on a positive record\nsweep of half a circle or less, so that record stays an arc.\n\nRefs #3474\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
